  <dialog id="install-dialog" aria-labelledby="install-title"><button class="close icon-button" data-close aria-label="Close installation help"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/assets/icons.svg?v=4#x"/></svg></button><h2 id="install-title">Take the arcade with you.</h2><p id="install-instructions"></p><p>Wait for <strong>Ready to play offline</strong> before disconnecting. All sixteen worlds, power-ups, music, cutscenes and scorecards will be available.</p><p>Save scores as usual. They join the shared leaderboard when you reconnect and open the game.</p><button class="button primary" data-close>Got it</button></dialog>
